    a: "X-Ray follows one request through API Gateway, Lambda, DynamoDB and other services using a trace ID, and shows a service map and a timeline of segments, so I can see which hop is slow or failing. On Lambda I turn on active tracing and add the Powertools Tracer to annotate my own code; for new instrumentation AWS recommends OpenTelemetry through the ADOT distro, which can still send traces to X-Ray. I add annotations like orderId so I can search traces, and I sample instead of tracing 100% of busy production traffic.",
